<title>USA: Bay Area raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Bay Area raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Area Bancshares said its board declared a cash dividend of $0.09 per share to common stock shareholders of record as of December 27, 1995.</p>
<p>This dividend, which represents a 12.5 percent increase, is the company's twenty-first consecutive quarterly cash dividend and is payable January 3, 1997.</p>
</text>
